1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,070
In Voltura Air on your PC, open Connection.

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:08,453
Under Connection method, select Cloud relay through Voltura.

3
00:00:08,453 --> 00:00:16,159
Both devices connect outward through Voltura, so you don't need to open an incoming router port or firewall exception.

4
00:00:16,159 --> 00:00:21,121
Leave Custom relay endpoint unchanged to use Voltura's service.

